{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778220/extras/4ba16cc46baee5a5bcf0c1aa02a0d10f.webp?t=1770354374\" width=478 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u201cPalm Sugar: A Village Story\u201d, fight to free your home from a brutal drug cartel while exploring the lively landscape of a fictitious village in South India. Play as Srinu, a sharp-tongued, quick-witted young hero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield weapons, outsmart your enemies, and cross paths with a cast of unforgettable characters. Engage in dialogue-rich levels packed with humor, sarcasm, and heart - and throw in a few heroic stunts to impress the girl of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778220/extras/ba4dd202ff7e378946aeb1c3dceb9c38.webp?t=1770354374\" width=478 height=33 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative adventure steeped in the rich and vibrant culture of South India.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons that are native to rural life, such as sticks, axes and slingshots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade quest items to progress through the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a heartfelt soundtrack infused with the rich sounds of South India\u2019s villages. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778220/extras/f080583f711c47ccf4d9130eb84ba1f0.avif?t=1770354374\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2778220?t=1770354374